{"subject_id": "9010250", "chunk_id": "791c2db66751", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "建筑行业仍是国民经济的支柱产业之一", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 5, "source": "candidate_mixed", "created_at": "2026-04-01T09:32:11", "source_id": "detail_9010250_0", "order": 2, "used_fallback": true, "title": "建筑行业仍是国民经济的支柱产业之一", "text": "自 2003 年以来，建筑业总产值增长迅速，从 2003 年的 2.31 万亿元，到 2019 年已超过 24.84 万亿元，增长超过 10 倍。同时，自 2009 年以来，建筑业贡献的 GDP 占我国 GDP 总量比重持续超过 6.5%，近年来已经超过 7%以上。\n2.3 建筑业从业人数及占总人口比重", "uid": "778791d64093", "decision": "drop", "confidence": 0.5, "knowledge_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from judge response", "knowledge_spans": [], "event_residue": "", "drop_target": "noise"}
{"subject_id": "9010250", "chunk_id": "b796fd536dbd", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "建筑行业仍是国民经济的支柱产业之一", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 6, "source": "candidate_mixed", "created_at": "2026-04-01T09:32:11", "source_id": "detail_9010250_0", "order": 3, "used_fallback": true, "title": "建筑行业仍是国民经济的支柱产业之一", "text": "除总产值和对 GDP 的贡献巨大外，建筑业的从业人数也众多。2003 年 12 月，建筑业从业人口约 2414 万人，占总人口比重约 1.87%；至 2019 年 12 月，从业人数已达 5427万人，占总人口的比重超过 3.88%。建筑业对就业人口的影响巨大。", "uid": "013d97060c8d", "decision": "drop", "confidence": 0.5, "knowledge_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from judge response", "knowledge_spans": [], "event_residue": "", "drop_target": "noise"}
{"subject_id": "9010250", "chunk_id": "8dcd16bb51cc", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "建筑业细分行业产值比重", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 7, "source": "candidate_mixed", "created_at": "2026-04-01T09:32:11", "source_id": "detail_9010250_0", "order": 0, "used_fallback": true, "title": "建筑业细分行业产值比重", "text": "在建筑业的总体产值中，细分行业房屋建筑业产值占比长期在 60%以上，体现了房地产投资对于建筑业产值的拉动作用；土木工程建筑业产值占比在 25%以上，体现了基础设施建设投资对于建筑业的影响。而建筑安装业及建筑装饰和其他建筑业总产值占建筑业总产值较低，均在 10%以下。", "uid": "8be1b5d9eb5b", "decision": "drop", "confidence": 0.5, "knowledge_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from judge response", "knowledge_spans": [], "event_residue": "", "drop_target": "noise"}
{"subject_id": "9010250", "chunk_id": "1438ec98768c", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "建筑业产值增速与固定资产投资增速趋势对比", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 8, "source": "candidate_mixed", "created_at": "2026-04-01T09:32:11", "source_id": "detail_9010250_0", "order": 0, "used_fallback": true, "title": "建筑业产值增速与固定资产投资增速趋势对比", "text": "建筑行业是典型的投资拉动型行业，行业景气度与固定资产投资紧密相关，尤其是房屋建筑及基础设施建设领域需求受固定资产投资影响显著。", "uid": "81b0306d0e4a", "decision": "drop", "confidence": 0.5, "knowledge_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from judge response", "knowledge_spans": [], "event_residue": "", "drop_target": "noise"}
